 gh:127\n  title: Grill whether range should become a Stream source -- Q1/Q13 amendment to ADR 0001 (prelude-inventory approved finding, gh:105/gh:121)\n  kind: decide\n  needs: []\n  status: todo\n\n- id: q37-float-semantics\n  title: Grill Q37 -- float printing agreement, NaN/Infinity, division by zero\n  kind: decide\n  needs: []\n  status: todo\n\n- id: benchmark-goals\n  title: Grill what workloads define the performance thesis, then plan the benchmark suite\n  kind: decide\n  needs: []\n  prio: 4\n  status: todo\n\n- id: float-build\n  title: Implement Float (IEEE binary64 per ADR 0007) across the backends\n  kind: build\n  needs: [q37-float-semantics]\n  status: todo\n\n- id: lines-utf8-edge\n  issue: gh:102\n  title: Pin what a non-UTF-8 byte arriving via lines does, on every backend\n  kind: decide\n  needs: []\n  status: todo\n\n- id: jq-printer-cycle-refusal\n  issue: gh:116\n  title: jq -- recursive-enum printers refuse a mutual cycle the way ordered() refuses one (issue-94 review)\n  kind: build\n  needs: []\n  prio: 3\n  soft: [concat-retirement]","lineStart":100,"lineEnd":219,"totalLines":444,"truncated":true}},"title":"plans/board.yaml","time":{"start":1788297879619,"end":1788297879628}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me look at the shell-out-design board row in plans/board.yaml around line 135, and any linked documents.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05edc203b001kklfN3pInm2jB1","sessionID":"ses_fa1260da9ffea7gMsosoWnpMXr","messageID":"msg_05edc1880001mh9Upo3cNiIHJL"}}
